2E FORTH OS  VERSION 1.0

A DIRECT-THREADED 6502 FORTH FOR THE
APPLE //E.  IT BOOTS TO AN 80-COLUMN
CONSOLE AND STOPS AT THE FORTH PROMPT.
THERE IS NO DOS ON THIS DISK: THE BOOT
SECTOR AND THE DISK DRIVER ARE ITS OWN.

  CAT          LIST THIS DISK
  HELP         A SUMMARY
  HELP HGR     HELP FOR ANY ONE WORD
  WORDS        EVERY DEFINITION
  N DRIVE      SWITCH DRIVES, 1 OR 2
  N LOAD       COMPILE A TEXT FILE
  N DEL        N REN        N LOCK
  ADDR LEN SAVE      WRITE A FILE

THE GRAPHICS SCREEN IS A THING THE
LANGUAGE TURNS ON, NOT THE INTERFACE:

  HGR          560X192 MONOCHROME
  TEXT         BACK TO THIS CONSOLE
  3 HCOLOR  100 50 HPLOT
  0 559 96 HLINE   280 96 60 HDISC

EVERY PROGRAM IS ON THE DISK IN DRIVE
TWO -- THE DEMOS, THE TUTORIALS, AND
THE GAMES: LANDER, BREAKOUT, HAT.

  2 DRIVE      SWITCH TO IT
  CAT          SEE THE PROGRAMS
  N LOAD       LOAD ONE BY ITS NUMBER

EACH ONE TELLS YOU WHAT TO TYPE WHEN
IT FINISHES LOADING.  YOUR OWN WORK
BELONGS THERE TOO: IT IS NEARLY ALL
FREE SPACE.  1 DRIVE COMES BACK HERE.

THIS DISK CARRIES TOOLS AS WELL:
MENU.FTH ASKS WHICH PROGRAM TO LOAD,
AND MORE.FTH PAGES THROUGH ANY FILE.

